mental business conducted at court was the hearing of cases, often involving the disputed possession of cattle or women by the Hima. The appointment and dismissal of military and administrative functionaries from among those aristocratic Hima and Hinda princes who regularly attended court was the Mugabe\'s sole administrative function."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 867, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 772})
